  "body": "## Changelog\n* 85a775781784b3168282cca066b475c3e72acb8c Add managed Postgres user password rotation (#5285)\n* 3158889828bd466423f18e6fb7142f1ddb766385 Remove the web limit preflight for bluegreen deploys (#5292)\n* 2c69cf2c145225819abd7834dcb44f0f93e07f98 Emit MDX from the docs generator and resume the sync (#5287)\n* c555cac52d67c915014d490aa8f4a2fa0cf7ed74 Stop fly launch guessing when it cannot ask (#5267)\n* 622cf9e4c3fe6efe168b5f816717ab0fc780ec08 Fail builds over to HTTPS only when they went over WireGuard (#5283)\n* fbe20345edbf93123613f4de233b3b83994da613 Let fly launch --yes attach to an existing Postgres database (#5282)\n\n"
